// Two stations that work.
//
// This is the one to get running first, and not as a stepping stone to the real thing: the whole of
// the coordination is the handshake between one station and the next, and two stations contain it
// completely. What four stations add is three copies of a problem already solved.
//
// workSteps  - how many steps the station's own sequence has. They do nothing; they are where real
//              actuation goes. See spec/patterns/station.scl.tmpl.
// dwellCycles - scan cycles each step occupies. Without it a sequence finishes in one scan and
//              nothing is observable in a watch table.
{
  "cell": "TwoStationDemo",
  "stations": [
    { "name": "Feeder", "workSteps": 2, "dwellCycles": 5 },
    { "name": "Driller", "workSteps": 3, "dwellCycles": 10 }
  ]
}
